      "part_type": "Hadith",
      "path": "/books/al-khisal:5:45:1",
      "source_url": "https://thaqalayn.net/hadith/10/5/45/1",
      "text": [
        ": قال رسول الله صلى الله عليه وآله: أربع من كن فيه نشر الله عليه كنفه وأدخله الجنة في رحمته: حسن خلق يعيش به في الناس، ورفق بالمكروب وشفقة على الوالدين، وإحسان إلى المملوك"
      ],
      "translations": {
        "en.dr-ali-peiravi": [
          "4-57 Ahmad ibn Ali ibn Ibrahim ibn Hashim narrated that his father quoted his father, on the authority of his grandfather, on the authority of Abdullah ibn Maymun , on the authority of Ja’far ibn Muhammad as-Sadiq (MGB), on the authority of his father (MGB) that God’s Prophet (MGB) said, “Whoever has four characteristics shall be protected by God and taken to Paradise: being good-tempered so as to live amongst the people; sympathizing with the ones who have suffered from calamities; being kind to their parents; and treating servants kindly.”"
        ]
      }
    },
